==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|White}} comes up with the [[Pokémon Musical]] as the next tourist attraction for [[Nimbasa City]].
* {{adv|Black}} defeats [[Lenora]].
* [[Clay]] calls Lenora about the [[Dark Stone]] he discovered. The [[Shadow Triad]] spies on them.
* Black meets [[Gorm]].
* {{p|Virizion}} appears.
* Black and [[Bo|Tep]] meet a {{TP|N|Zorua}} which disguises himself as a young boy.
* {{adv|Bianca}}'s {{p|Litwick}} is stolen by [[Team Plasma]].
* Black defeats [[Burgh]].
* Black and White meet [[Bronius]].

