==Errors==
* The chapters in the Japanese version of this volume are numbered incorrectly. While {{PAV|44}} closes with [[PS471]], this volume's chapters are numbered 471-478, while in reality these chapters are 472-479. They are all numbered incorrectly on both the title pages and on the table of contents.

